-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> routes from B to A.</p>\n</li><p></p>\n<p></p><li><p>There are no arrows starting at Station C and ending at Station C. So, there are no routes from C to C.</p>\n</li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<p></p><p>Therefore, our route matrix is the following:</p><p></p>\n<table rules=\"all\" cellpadding=\"10\" align=\"center\" style=\"border:1px solid black; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 4mm; margin-top: 4mm\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:hidden\"></td>\n<td style=\"border:hidden\"></td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center; border-top:hidden; border-right:hidden\">To:</td> \n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:hidden\"></td>\n<td></td>\n<td width=\"30\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>A</b></td>\n<td width=\"30\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>B</b></td>\n<td width=\"30\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>C</b></td> \n<td width=\"30\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>D</b></td> \n</tr>\n\n<tr> \n<td rowspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center; border-left:hidden; border-bottom:hidden\">From:</td>\n<td width=\"30\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>A</b></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"323\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"324\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative